OL,3,ACatherine joins William at suicide
OL,4,Aprevention campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Princess of Wales has made a
OL,7,Fsurprise appearance alongside her
OL,8,Fhusband the Prince of Wales, as he
OL,9,Fcalls on the sports sector to help
OL,10,Fprevent suicides.
OL,12,FPrince William and Catherine are at
OL,13,FEverton's football ground in Liverpool
OL,14,Fto launch a project encouraging people
OL,15,Fto remove the stigma around mental
OL,16,Fhealth challenges and to encourage
OL,17,Fpeople to seek help.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
